fact WorkItem(id: "WI-019", description: some(value: "Error collection and reporting in typing pass: assert_compatible calls error() but how errors are gathered with source positions from ExprOccurrence spans and reported to the user."), context: none, acceptance: [ToolPasses(tool: "cargo-test", params: none)], depends_on: some(value: ["WI-031", "WI-032", "WI-038"]), generates: none, requires_capability: none, status: Delivered(agent: "claude", at: "2026-05-03T20:04:35Z"))

fact Feedback(workitem: "WI-019", author: "user", content: "Implemented. typing pass now collects errors as structured TypeError values via type_check_sorts_typed. New TypeError::Other variant + TypeErrorContext (EntityField/OperationReturn/OperationEffects/OperationMatch/Rule/Anonymous) carry Symbols for entity/field/op names instead of strings. TypeError::to_load_error(&kb) provides lossy back-compat for existing LoadError consumers; type_check_sorts wraps type_check_sorts_typed via that conversion. All 12 emission sites in typing.rs (check_value_against_*, check_entity_facts, check_operation_bodies, check_pattern_fragment, check_ho_apply_pattern, check_rule_typing) migrated. Public API unchanged for legacy callers. 4 new tests in tests/typing_test.rs::wi_019: structured field mismatch, return-type mismatch, span resolution, legacy LoadError compatibility.", at: "2026-05-03T20:04:35Z")
